OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FA massive wildfire in eastern Belgium
OL,7,Fhas led to hundreds of people being
OL,8,Fevacuated from their homes as
OL,9,Ffirefighters battle to contain the
OL,10,Fblaze.
OL,12,FAbout 600 residents in the nearby
OL,13,Fmunicipalities of Waimes and
OL,14,FButgenbach, in Liege province near the
OL,15,FGerman border, were told to evacuate
OL,16,Fon Saturday as winds shifted and smoke
OL,17,Fspread through the High Fens, a large
OL,18,Fnature reserve.
OL,26,@vD@BxzvD@Rqr
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
