OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786929479
OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FAuthorities also advised tourists to
OL,7,Fleave, while a nearby gymnasium was
OL,8,Fopened to receive evacuees.
OL,10,FLiege provincial governor Herve Jamar
OL,11,Fsaid in a statement Sunday that more
OL,12,Fthan 250 emergency personnel have been
OL,13,Fdeployed, including over 100 Belgian
OL,14,Fand German firefighters, as well as
OL,15,Fpolice and military officers and civil
OL,16,Fprotection staff.
OL,18,FFirefighting helicopters operated by
OL,19,FBelgium's federal police and the
OL,20,FNetherlands also helped.
OL,26,@rD@CqrrD@_rr
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
