OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786929479
OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FRene Dahmen, chief engineer at the
OL,7,FDepartment of Nature and Forest, said
OL,8,Fthe fire was still spreading on Sunday
OL,9,Fin an area that was difficult for
OL,10,Fcrews to reach.
OL,12,F"On the eastern flank, there's a line
OL,13,Fat least a kilometre long where the
OL,14,Ffire is slowly advancing toward a
OL,15,Fmunicipal forest," Dahmen said.
OL,16,F"That's the first priority now; we
OL,17,Fdeployed resources last night, and the
OL,18,Ffirefighters are ready, in case it
OL,19,Fgets too close."
OL,26,@nD@DrrtD@AOUwD@RO]xD@AOU{D@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
