SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786929479
OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,F"The situation is extremely
OL,7,Fdifficult," Dahmen added. "We need
OL,8,Fhelicopter support."
OL,10,FAuthorities said no homes had been
OL,11,Faffected as of Sunday morning, though
OL,12,Fthe fire remained close to residential
OL,13,Fareas and heavy smoke persisted.
OL,15,FThey urged people to stay away from
OL,16,Fthe fire zone, warning that
OL,17,Funnecessary traffic could obstruct
OL,18,Femergency vehicles and complicate
OL,19,Ffirefighting operations.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@KO]oD@[OUpD@TO]
