OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FBelgium activated the European Union's
OL,7,Fcivil protection mechanism to receive
OL,8,Fassistance from other countries, EU
OL,9,FCommissioner Hadja Lahbib, who is in
OL,10,Fcharge of crisis management, said on X.
OL,12,F"The High Fens are burning. Belgium is
OL,13,Fnot facing it alone," Lahbib said.
OL,14,FSweden sent two water-bombing
OL,15,Faircraft, while three helicopters `
OL,16,Ftwo from the Netherlands and one from
OL,17,Fthe Czech Republic ` were also being
OL,18,Fdeployed.
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@UO]
