OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FThe fire follows weeks of unusually
OL,7,Fhot and dry weather. The High Fens'
OL,8,Fmix of heathland and peat bogs has
OL,9,Fcomplicated efforts to contain the
OL,10,Fflames.
OL,12,FBelgium was hit by another spell of
OL,13,Fintense heat this week, with
OL,14,Ftemperatures reaching about 37C in
OL,15,Fparts of the country on Friday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
