FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786929479
OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FThe blaze has far surpassed a 2011
OL,7,Ffire that burned nearly 5.4 square
OL,8,Fmiles in the same area and was
OL,9,Fpreviously Belgium's largest wildfire
OL,10,Fon record, according to data from the
OL,11,FEuropean Forest Fire Information
OL,12,FSystem.
OL,14,FNicolas Yernaux, a spokesperson for
OL,15,Fthe Public Service of Wallonia, said
OL,16,Fconditions were much worse this time.
OL,17,F"We're dealing with something much
OL,18,Fdeeper because we have very dry soil,"
OL,19,Fhe said.
OL,26,@yD@AOUzD@fO]
