OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,9,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
OL,11,FIn the nearby town of Monschau, in
OL,12,FGermany, local authorities warned
OL,13,FSunday that the fire was about just
OL,14,Funder a mile from the border. The
OL,15,Fblaze is not currently expected to
OL,16,Freach German territory ` but the smoke
OL,17,Fis.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
