OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FA little further inside Germany,
OL,7,Femergency services were making
OL,8,Fsignificant progress in fighting a
OL,9,Ffire in the Hurtgen forest that forced
OL,10,Fevacuations on Friday. The roughly
OL,11,F2,000 people who had to leave the
OL,12,Fvillage of Gey were able to return
OL,13,Fhome on Saturday evening, German news
OL,14,Fagency dpa reported.
OL,26,@qD@Nxz
