OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786929479
OL,3,CFirefighters battle massive Belgian
OL,4,Cwildfire as hundreds evacuated
OL,6,FOn Sunday morning, the local
OL,7,Fgovernment in Duren said there were no
OL,8,Flonger any open flames, and that the
OL,9,Faffected area was now surrounded by a
OL,10,Froughly 3-meter (10-foot) cleared
OL,11,Fcordon to prevent the fire from
OL,12,Fspreading further.
OL,14,FMuch of Europe and the UK is facing
OL,15,Fthe same issue, with firefighters
OL,16,Facross the continent deployed to
OL,17,Ftackle blazes in remote dry places
OL,18,Fwhere rain has not been seen for weeks.
OL,26,@oD@Pxz
